WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
On weekdays, I usually get up at half past seven.
工作日我通常七点半起床。

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.970
I make some tea before I check my messages.
我先泡点茶，再看消息。

3
00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.140
My office is nearby, so I walk to work.
办公室就在附近，所以我走路上班。

4
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.880
The walk takes about twenty minutes.
走过去大约要二十分钟。

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.790
At lunchtime, I often eat with a colleague.
午餐时间我经常和一位同事一起吃饭。

6
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:25.370
After work, I sometimes go for a short run.
下班后，我有时会去短跑一会儿。

7
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:29.090
I try to put my phone away before bed.
睡前我尽量把手机放到一边。

8
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:35.040
At weekends, I sleep a little longer. How about you?
周末我会多睡一会儿。你呢？
